		Heading 1:
			Text: Nested lists
		Paragraph: A `List item` holds one or more elements, and one of them can be another `List`. The inner list declares its own `Marker`, starts counting again and does not take the `Marker suffix` of the outer one.
			Style: intro
		List:
			Marker: decimal
			Marker suffix: parenthesis
			List item:
				Paragraph: Switch off the power.
			List item:
